:: StoryTitle
The Ninefold Cell: the duel, step 1 (`like` for acts)

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "<generated by Twine>",
  "format": "Inkjot",
  "format-version": "0.6.0",
  "start": "sanctum"
}

:: Inklink [config]
(((
Step 1 of `define` (docs/define.md): acts may be `like` an archetype, and
take its clauses. Only the parts that differ from `ex2-duel-general.twee`
are here; everything else is as written there.

What step 1 adds to the general words:

| Word | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `archetype x ~ …` holding act clauses | `cost`, `when`, `for`, `at`, tags: whatever an act can say |
| `act y ~ like x` | y takes x's clauses; its own come after and win. A `when` joins x's with `and` |
| `~ verb cast` | The word the platform uses for taking it: "Roland casts Rime Shield on Eldric" |
| `when` and `for` on an act | Its Links take them, joined with their own |

The archetype's name is also a tag, as `like statue` already is, so
`~ like spell` still counts as `spell`.
)))

archetype cantrip ~ cost 10 ~ verb speak
archetype spell ~ verb cast ~ for roland
archetype steel ~ for eldric ~ when not me.frozen

act strike ~ like steel ~ cost 20 ~ when hask.grounded and me.holds.any(sword)
act guard ~ like steel ~ cost 20
act raise ~ like steel ~ cost 20 ~ when me.holds.lumen
act shatter ~ like steel ~ cost 20 ~ loud ~ at mirror here ~ when target.open
act smash ~ like steel ~ cost 20 ~ loud ~ when me.holds.heart

item abelard_sword: "Abelard’s longsword" ~ like sword ~ deflects fire ~ in well
item lumen: "Lumen, the holy sword of the Dawn" ~ like sword ~ holy ~ absorbs any ~ in orrery ~ fixed until orrery.aligned

on absorb with lumen
~ then set lumen.charged: yes

:: roland [character]
state rewound: no
--
act spark ~ like cantrip ~ "a snap of heat and light at a point you can see"
act chill ~ like cantrip ~ "frost on a surface, or a mouthful of water turned to ice"
act gust ~ like cantrip ~ "one breath of wind, enough to snuff a candle across a room"
act mend ~ like cantrip ~ "knits a small break: a torn page, a cracked pin, a split lip"
act tug ~ like cantrip ~ "an unseen pull on something lighter than a book, within sight"
act hush ~ like cantrip ~ quiet ~ "swallows one sound for a moment"

combo ember_lance: spark, gust, spark ~ like spell ~ fire ~ "flame, fanned, then lit into a lance"
~ at character here ~ when target.frozen
~ then set target.frozen: no
combo rime_shield: chill, mend, chill ~ like spell ~ frost ~ "a shell of ice that heals its own cracks"
~ at character here
~ then cover target
combo frostglass: chill, gust ~ like spell ~ frost ~ "rimes a mirror over until it shows nothing"
~ at mirror here ~ when target.open
~ then set target.open: no
combo thunderclap: hush, gust, spark ~ like spell ~ loud ~ "a swallowed sound, carried, then let go at once"
~ then prevent hask when hask.rhyme.next in [flame, frost]
combo backward_knot: mend, hush, tug, mend ~ like spell ~ "ties the hour back on itself"
~ rewind ~ once per turn ~ requires pov.all alive

act lodestone: cost 30 ~ like spell ~ learned from lodestone ~ when roland.knows.lodestone
~ "makes one thing very, very heavy, for one breath"
~ at npc here
~ then set target.grounded: yes
~ then pin target

:: sanctum:round [round]
(((The text above the Links is as in the general draft.)))
--
> [[Ember Lance at {target}’s ice->sanctum:lance]] ~ ember_lance
> [[Rime Shield on {target}->sanctum:shield]] ~ rime_shield
> [[Frostglass {target}->sanctum:frostglass]] ~ frostglass
> [[Thunderclap->sanctum:thunderclap]] ~ thunderclap
> [[Lodestone->sanctum:lodestone]] ~ lodestone
> [[Hand him the heart->sanctum:hand_over]] ~ cost 0 ~ for roland ~ when me.holds.heart

> [[Strike->sanctum:strike]] ~ strike
> [[Guard Roland->sanctum:guard]] ~ guard
> [[Raise Lumen->sanctum:absorb]] ~ raise
> [[Shatter {target}->sanctum:shatter]] ~ shatter
> [[Smash his heart->sanctum:smash]] ~ smash

> [[Hold up his heart->sanctum:show_heart]] ~ cost 10 ~ when me.holds.heart and not hask.shown_heart
> [[As one->sanctum:as_one]]
~ cost 30 from roland
~ cost 20 from eldric
~ when trust == 3 and eldric.holds.lumen and not eldric.frozen
~ for pov
> [[Let him cast->sanctum:spell]] ~ pass ~ ends turn
